  "description": "\"I am making a scout offer for the position of a wife to raise my child.\"     \n\"Excuse me?!\" \n\nSix months ago, I had a one-night stand with Choi Hyun-seo, a director at Miu F&C, whom I had been secretly crushing on. There was no reason to refuse him, a man born with a silver spoon and good looks. But now, he wants me to be his wife? To be the mother of his child... \n\n\"Director, I will be changing jobs.\" \n\nHowever, despite everything, I wanted to try living with him just once. I wanted to experience a marriage that felt like a workplace with a man I could never confess my unrequited love to. Even if the end of this contract is a resignation.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14255175)   \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14255174)",
